OL,3,GNEWSABritish paratroopers take part in
OL,4,Alarge drop
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 2,500 British and French
OL,7,Ftroops have been training for the
OL,8,Flargest parachute drop involving UK
OL,9,Fservice personnel in Europe since World
OL,10,FWar Two.
OL,12,FTroops from around the country,
OL,13,Fincluding the 3 PARA Battlegroup from
OL,14,FColchester, have been training with
OL,15,FNato in Germany as part of a seven-week
OL,16,Fdefence exercise.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
