OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABritish paratroopers take part in
OL,4,Alarge drop
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrig Ed Cartwright, commander of 16 Air
OL,7,FAssault Brigade, told the BBC: "Nato
OL,8,Fexists as a defensive alliance, this is
OL,9,Fabsolutely not provocative, this is
OL,10,Fsimply demonstrating that Nato in the
OL,11,FUK is ready for war."
OL,13,FThe Ministry of Defence (MoD) said the
OL,14,Fexercise helped troops rehearse the
OL,15,Fkind of rapid, co-ordinated operations
OL,16,Fthat modern conflicts demanded.
